:"Take a quiet campus pause, or attend a listed service if it aligns with your plans and beliefs; verify the current schedule before arrival.","short_summary":"A campus chapel used for worship, reflection, and university gatherings.","evidence_claim":"Niagara states that Sunday Mass is celebrated in Alumni Chapel during the semester and lists weekday and summer services; its facilities page identifies Alumni Chapel as a campus space.","source_url":"https://www.niagara.edu/about/campus-offices/so-much-to-do/","source_title":"So Much to Do | Niagara University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Service schedules can change by semester and season; confirm with Campus Ministry before planning around a service.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"niagara-power-vista","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Niagara Power Vista","title":"Try the exhibits at Niagara Power Vista","subtitle":"Saturday midday • beside campus on Lewiston Road","notes":"Explore the interactive exhibits and observation area, then use the visit to orient yourself to the Niagara River’s hydropower story.","short_summary":"A nearby hydropower visitor center with free admission and parking.","evidence_claim":"The New York Power Authority lists Niagara Power Vista at 5777 Lewiston Road, open seven days a week from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. except certain holidays, with free admission and parking.","source_url":"https://nypa.gov/Communities/Visitors-Centers/Niagara-Power-Vista","source_title":"Niagara Power Vista | New York Power Authority","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Listed hours are 9 a.m.–5 p.m. daily, with certain holiday closures; confirm before travel.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"whirlpool-state-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Whirlpool State Park","title":"Use the rim overlooks at Whirlpool State Park","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon • Niagara Gorge","notes":"Stay on the upper-level overlooks and marked paths for river views; check the trail notice first and skip closed or unstable gorge routes.","short_summary":"A year-round state park with overlooks, picnic areas, and Niagara Gorge trails.","evidence_claim":"New York State Parks says Whirlpool State Park is open year-round from dawn to dusk, has no vehicle entrance fee, and offers scenic overlooks at street level.","source_url":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/whirlpool/amenities-activities.aspx","source_title":"Whirlpool State Park | NYS Parks, Recreation & Historic Preservation","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open dawn to dusk. Review the official page’s active trail-closure notices and remain on open marked routes.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"niagara-falls-state-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Niagara Falls State Park","title":"Walk into Niagara Falls State Park","subtitle":"Saturday late afternoon • Niagara Falls, New York","notes":"Choose a well-marked walking route and take in the falls from the public park, leaving time to return before your transportation plan ends.","short_summary":"A public state-park visit centered on viewing the falls without an admission charge.","evidence_claim":"Niagara Falls State Park states that it is open 365 days a year and is always free to walk into the park and experience the falls.","source_url":"https://www.niagarafallsstatepark.com/park-information/","source_title":"Park Information | Niagara Falls State Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The park is open year-round; check current weather, park notices, and transportation arrangements before departure.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"cave-of-the-winds","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Cave of the Winds","title":"Reserve Cave of the Winds if you want a ticketed add-on","subtitle":"Saturday • Goat Island, Niagara Falls State Park","notes":"Book a timed ticket if the weather and schedule work, wear footwear that can get wet, and keep this as an optional paid portion of the outing.","short_summary":"A timed-ticket attraction that takes visitors to the Hurricane Deck near the falls.","evidence_claim":"Niagara Falls State Park describes Cave of the Winds as a timed-ticket attraction on Goat Island, open daily year-round, with footwear that may get wet recommended.","source_url":"https://www.niagarafallsstatepark.com/attractions/cave-of-the-winds/","source_title":"Cave of the Winds | Niagara Falls State Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Timed tickets are sold at Cave of the Winds or the Ralph C. Wilson, Jr. Welcome Center; its schedule and last-ticket times vary by date.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"aquarium-of-niagara","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Aquarium of Niagara","title":"Make Sunday an Aquarium of Niagara visit","subtitle":"Sunday daytime • 701 Whirlpool Street, Niagara Falls","notes":"Choose an entry window online or at the door, and plan enough time to see both the Main Building and Great Lakes 360 on one admission.","short_summary":"A two-building aquarium visit that includes Great Lakes 360 with general admission.","evidence_claim":"The Aquarium of Niagara says general admission includes both its Main Building and Great Lakes 360; tickets are available online and on-site, with weekend hours listed as 9 a.m. to 6 p.m.","source_url":"https://aquariumofniagara.org/admissions/","source_title":"Admissions | Aquarium of Niagara","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Friday–Sunday hours are listed as 9 a.m.–6 p.m.; last ticket is sold one hour before closing. Check holiday exceptions before visiting.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"niagara-kiernan-recreation-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Kiernan Recreation Center","title":"Finish with a Kiernan Recreation Center reset","subtitle":"Sunday evening • Niagara University campus","notes":"Bring the required credentials, choose an available activity, and make this a low-key close to the weekend rather than a strenuous first-day commitment.","short_summary":"Niagara’s campus recreation complex for fitness, pool, court, and wellness activities.","evidence_claim":"Niagara describes the Kiernan Recreation Center as an all-in-one recreation complex with more than 50 intramural, recreational, and health/wellness programs for the university community.","source_url":"https://www.niagara.edu/current-students/student-life/kiernan-recreation-center/","source_title":"Kiernan Recreation Center | Niagara University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Academic-year hours are listed as 8 a.m.–10 p.m. Monday–Thursday, 8 a.m.–9 p.m. Friday, and 9 a.m.–9 p.m. weekends; access may be restricted for scheduled activities.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
